      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewView.tsx",
      "content": "Reflection edits are reported as `debt:*`, but `onEntryDirty` only sets `actionDirty` for `action:*`. Consequently, entering reflection answers does not disable Trade selection, Continue, or blocker links; these can unmount the DebtForm and silently discard its values. Saving the Action can also advance the walk while a reflection draft exists. Include dirty reflection entries in the card-leaving guard and prevent Action-driven advancement from discarding them.",
      "existing_code": "      {walk \u0026\u0026 \u003cTradeWalk facade={facade} review={review} selected={selected} afterSave={afterSave} holdId={actionDirty ? holdId : undefined} onSelect={(tradeId) =\u003e void select(tradeId)} onSaved={saved} onReflectionResolved={reflectionResolved} onRefresh={refreshTrade} onEntryDirty={onEntryDirty} /\u003e}",
      "start_line": 404,
      "end_line": 404,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "high"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewReflections.tsx",
      "content": "DebtForm leaves Cancel enabled while submission is pending. If the user submits and cancels before the save completes, this unmounts the form holding the response state. The eventual `onResolved` marks the row resolved and mounts a fresh DebtForm, which has no saved outcome and instead displays an empty editable form for an already-resolved debt. Prevent closing during submission, or retain the saved result at row/parent level so it survives cancellation.",
      "existing_code": "      {(isOpen || resolved) \u0026\u0026 \u003cDebtForm definition={reflection.definition} binding={reflection.saveBinding} submit={submit} onResolved={onResolved} onCancel={resolved ? undefined : onClose} onDirtyChange={dirty} /\u003e}",
      "start_line": 59,
      "end_line": 59,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewView.tsx",
      "content": "The selection token is only allocated here, after `reopen()` finishes. While that request is pending, the existing Trade buttons remain enabled and `select` does not check `inFlight`. A user can follow a blocker link, then select a different Trade, only to have this older blocker request replace their newer selection when the refresh finishes. Capture/check a navigation token before awaiting `reopen`, or disable all card navigation for the entire operation.",
      "existing_code": "    await select(tradeId, result);",
